<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>رسالة من الحصان الرياضي</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Readex+Pro:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#F4F6F5; }
  a { color:#14532D; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .ah-card { border-radius:0 !important; } .ah-pad { padding:24px 20px !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body dir="rtl" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F4F6F5">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F4F6F5"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 8px">
<table role="presentation" class="ah-card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
  <tr><td style="background:#ffffff;padding:22px 28px;text-align:center">
    {% if shop.email_logo_url %}<img src="{{ shop.email_logo_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width | default: 170 }}" style="max-width:210px;height:auto">{% else %}<span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#14532D">{{ shop.name }}</span>{% endif %}
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="height:5px;line-height:5px;background:#14532D">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="height:3px;line-height:3px;background:#B6F23A">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="ah-pad" style="padding:32px 36px;text-align:right;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;color:#0B0F0C">
<div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B332E">{{ custom_message }}</div>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:22px 28px;background:#F3F8EE;text-align:center;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C">لديك سؤال؟ نرد بسرعة عبر واتساب.</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/966573873497" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:#1FA855;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">تواصل عبر واتساب</a>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 26px;text-align:center;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0B0F0C">تابعنا</p>
    <a href="https://www.snapchat.com/@athletic_horse" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFC00;color:#111111;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">Snapchat</a><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@athletic_horse" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#111111;color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">TikTok</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/athletic_horseksa" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0B0F0C;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">Instagram</a><a href="https://wa.me/966573873497" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0B0F0C;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">WhatsApp</a>
    <p style="margin:14px 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#5B6660">إرجاع سهل خلال 3 أيام من الاستلام.</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#5B6660">شركة الحصان الرياضي · س.ت 7053046608 · الرقم الضريبي 314498395700003</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#5B6660">البغدادية الشرقية، جدة، المملكة العربية السعودية · <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color:#14532D">{{ shop.url | remove: 'https://' }}</a></p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>